@*
    Zero-field Observe action editor. Rendered into the action-editor slot
    by HTMX when the action-kind selector flips to "observe". Observe has no
    metadata to capture -- the rule counts matches but emits no
    enforcement. The rule's Mode dropdown (Draft / Shadow / LIVE) is the
    way to escalate when ready.
*@
<fieldset class="sb-edit-action" data-edit-action-kind="observe">
    <legend>Observe</legend>
    <p class="sb-edit-action-empty">No parameters. The rule counts matches but emits no enforcement. Use the rule's <strong>Mode</strong> dropdown to flip to LIVE when ready.</p>
</fieldset>